# ## 13. Conclusion
# 
# This project analysed over 120,000 Steam games to understand what makes a game successful.  
# We found that free-to-play, multiplayer games in popular genres tend to perform best.  
# Our machine learning models showed that even basic game features can predict popularity to a reasonable extent.
# 
